OL,3,GNEWSAMan who killed mum in 'savage'
OL,4,Aattack jailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who killed his mother at their
OL,7,Fhome in a "savage and brutal" attack
OL,8,Fhas been jailed for life with a minimum
OL,9,Fterm of 20 years.
OL,11,FCarl Rundle, 42, murdered 64-year-old
OL,12,FHelen Rundle at her home in The Park,
OL,13,FHarwell, where he had been staying, on
OL,14,F27 January. He was found guilty of
OL,15,Fmurder following a trial at Oxford
OL,16,FCrown Court.
OL,18,FThe jury heard his victim suffered "no
OL,19,Fless than" 81 blunt force injuries in
OL,20,Fthe attack, which the defendant also
OL,21,Ffilmed.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
